message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Aegis SDM Monte Carlo Simulator: counter-check policies for NTAG 424 DNA TT"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
repository-code: "https://github.com/Wesley-Taruna/Aegis-Monte-carlo"
authors:
  - given-names: Wesley Nehemia
    family-names: Taruna
    affiliation: "School of Information Systems, Bina Nusantara University"
  - given-names: Julian Farrel
    family-names: Lie
    affiliation: "School of Information Systems, Bina Nusantara University"
  - given-names: Robertus Nugroho Perwiro
    family-names: Atmojo
    affiliation: "School of Information Systems, Bina Nusantara University"
keywords:
  - NFC
  - NTAG 424 DNA
  - Secure Dynamic Messaging
  - AES-CMAC
  - replay protection
  - Monte Carlo simulation
abstract: >-
  Monte Carlo simulator of server-side counter-check policies for NXP NTAG 424
  DNA TT Secure Dynamic Messaging. It models the tag, the verifier, honest
  owners over a lossy and reordering channel, and five attackers, and reports
  honest false-reject and attack-acceptance rates with 95% Wilson intervals.
